# Trading Hero Cards.

**Authors:** Gura, Mark

## Abstract
By borrowing from pop culture, New York City teacher created Trading Heroes, &quot;values clarification course&quot; drawing on powerful hero phenomenon and students' creativity. Following a discussion of heroic qualities, students select one or more personal heroes as subjects for trading cards they will produce themselves. Students make the cards by creating short biographies and portraits of their chosen heroes. (MLH)

